# Corpus unit lbcs/C03 — gap (an analytic theorem the artifact never discharges)
#
# Source: m0/annotations/lbcs.yaml C03 (descriptive, scheme dose_response; corpus pin 62e9b54).
# Headline: Theorem 2 — under Conditions 1 (Progressable) and 2 (Stable Moving), LBCS converges
# eps-optimally (almost surely, P_{t->inf}[f2(mt) <= f2*] = 1). The artifact's cited support is
# an empirical search-time sweep (E03: accuracy plateaus at T>=500, coreset size keeps
# shrinking) plus E06 joint-reduction corroboration.
#
# Lowering notes (conventions: corpus-units/LOWERING.md):
#   * Scheme divergence, recorded per the uniform-standard rule: the annotator chose
#     dose_response (the evidence actually offered — vary T, observe plateau), but the claim IS
#     Theorem 2, an analytic result. Per the T2 instruction it lowers through analytic_argument
#     (conclusion holds_analytically(lbcs_eps_convergence)); the empirical T-sweep is
#     corroboration, not a discharge of the derivation. The strict arithmetic/proof-recheck
#     adapter that would certify Theorem 2 (a mechanized proof checker) does not exist yet, so
#     analytic_argument stays defeasible; migration to a strict rule + certificate is future
#     work (corpus-v1 design note; LOWERING §Scheme family map).
#   * Both mandatory analytic CQs are unmet-gap: assumptions_established (Conditions 1-2 are
#     never operationalized or checked — they appear only in the claim statement) and
#     scope_licensed (the finite-T sweep, T<=2000, never bridges to the t->inf probability-1
#     statement). Two open mandatory obligations make the argument an IncompleteArgument
#     rejection, so no complete analytic_argument is declarable — E2-style gap on empty
#     complete support (adaptive-pruning/C03 pattern). The optional CQs (repetition count,
#     single dataset/model pair) are also unmet and simply omitted.
#   * The derivation itself is not shipped: the claim's Proof field points only at empirical
#     E03/E06, so the principal premise derives(theorem2_proof, lbcs_eps_convergence) is merely
#     ATTESTED (the paper asserts the appendix proof), deepening the gap beyond the two CQs.
#   * Coverage flag (kind-a, summary §3): the asymptotic almost-sure modality has no direct
#     construct; eps, f2*, and the P=1 limit live in nl, audited on faithfulness.
#
# Expected verdict is at the bottom of this file (golden oracle).

artifact lbcs at sha256:0cc27415e6b1
policy corpus-v1
use backends [nd@1]

# --- The headline claim, stated but not assemblable at corpus-v1's evidential bar --------------

claim c03
  nl      = "Theorem 2: under Conditions 1 (Progressable) and 2 (Stable Moving), LBCS converges eps-optimally, with f2(mt) reaching within eps of f2* almost surely as t -> infinity; the artifact corroborates only empirically via the E03 search-time plateau and E06 joint reduction"
  formal  = holds_analytically(lbcs_eps_convergence)
  binding = { author = m0-annotator, audit-status = unreviewed }

# --- Evidence leaf is present ... ---------------------------------------------------------------

# Principal premise: the paper's Theorem 2 and its appendix proof are asserted (attested); the
# artifact ships the empirical corroboration (E03 T-sweep, E06) rather than the derivation, so
# this leaf is attested, not observed.
leaf e1 : derives(theorem2_proof, lbcs_eps_convergence)
  kind       = attested
  provenance = ai-executed
  refs       = [logic/claims.md#C03, Theorem-2, logic/experiments.md#E03, logic/experiments.md#E06, Table-7, Table-1, trace/exploration_tree.yaml#N08, trace/exploration_tree.yaml#N12]

# --- ... but no complete argument is declarable -------------------------------------------------

# (Intentionally no `arg`: assumptions_established(theorem2_proof) — Conditions 1-2 unverified —
# and scope_licensed(lbcs_eps_convergence) — finite-T does not license the t->inf limit — are
# both mandatory and both unmet, and derives is only attested. The complete-support set is empty.)

status c03

# ==============================================================================================
